    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d834">

                <pb facs="1000" n="984" sameAs="frus:frus1947v08/pg984"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">834.00/6–347: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Embassy in Paraguay </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-06-06T15:00:00-04:00">June 6, 1947—3
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>152. Urtel 299 June 3, 6 PM and 300, 301 June 4, 10 AM and noon.<anchor n="35"
                        xml:id="d834-f1"/> Fol for your own info: No approach made to date by
                    Brazilian Govt but shd matter be raised Dept wd not at this juncture favor any
                    action that might be construed as pressure by this Govt on Morínigo Admin to
                    accept mediation.</p>
                <p>Repeated to Rio as 591 Montevideo as 192 BAires as 485.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Marshall</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d834-f1" n="35" xml:id="d834-f1-content">
                <p>Telegrams 299 and 301 not printed.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
